name: Jolly Joker — pair mult
author: corpus
description: >-
  Jolly Joker gives +8 Mult if the hand contains a Pair. First-shop pair payoff:
  level Pairs with Mercury and stack the chip counterpart Sly Joker; The Duo (X2
  on Pair) turns it exponential.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: JollyJoker
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: TheDuo
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: SlyJoker
    antes: [1, 2]
    score: 30
  - planetCard: Mercury
    antes: [1, 2]
    score: 20
